   TemplateBox[{
     RowBox[{
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["b", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["i", "TI"]]}]},
    "Abs"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "042125b7-c1e0-4219-a454-6496f7c013db"],
 " and the pairing ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[LeftAngleBracket]", 
    RowBox[{"-", ",", "-"}], "\[RightAngleBracket]"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "862e4c2b-5a8b-4950-9e4d-4a708471dd89"],
 " of degree ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["n", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4175b2d6-1d22-45ae-9f20-547f5f6c19a4"],
 " it has the following keys:"
}], "Notes",
 CellFrameLabels->{{Inherited, Inherited}, {Inherited, 
    Cell[
     TextData[{
      "26.09.30: Design review - the algebra is the object the \
AlgebraicModels part hands to the ChernSimons part: GradedPairing[algebra] \
reads the alphabet off it, and CanonicalMaurerCartan reads the canonical \
element off its triple product, so the dependency runs one way (R5c). It is \
built from data by PoincareDualityAlgebra[complex], from a \
CochainComplexWithPairing with a product, and not by a new constructor from \
degrees, Gram matrix and product, which an earlier report proposed: the \
four-argument CochainComplexWithPairing already takes that data and validates \
it, and the conversion is the inverse of CochainComplexWithPairing[algebra], \
so no new data shape enters the API (R3, kept by Pavel). A pairing that is \
not perfect gives a Failure, and a complex without a product returns \
unevaluated, since it has no triple product. The usage message sits beside \
the constructor from a complex since R5b. Prior art: the Wolfram Language has \
no Poincare duality algebras. T17 pins the two conversions as inverse to each \
other, and the algebra of the quotient of the complex of a model as the \
quotient of the model, on the fourteen catalogue models; the quotient itself \
is pinned against the engine of the verification suites.", "\n\n", 
       Cell[
        BoxData[
         GridBox[{{
            Cell[
             BoxData[
              ButtonBox[
               DynamicBox[
                FEPrivate`FrontEndResource[
                "DocumentationToolsStrings", "Edit"]], BaseStyle -> 
               "TextAnnotationButton"]]], 
            StyleBox[
             RowBox[{
               DynamicBox[
                FEPrivate`FrontEndResource[
                "DocumentationToolsStrings", "LastAnnotator"]], "pavel"}], 
             "TextAnnotator"], 
            Cell[
             BoxData[
              ButtonBox[
               DynamicBox[
                FEPrivate`FrontEndResource[
                "DocumentationToolsStrings", "Delete"]], BaseStyle -> 
               "TextAnnotationRemoveButton"]]], ""}}, 
          GridBoxAlignment -> {
           "Columns" -> {Left, Left, Right, Right}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}, 
          GridBoxItemSize -> {"Columns" -> {
              Scaled[0.15], 
              Scaled[0.68], 
              Scaled[0.15], 
              Scaled[0.02]}}]]], "\n"}], "TextAnnotation", 
     CellSize -> {590, Inherited}]}},
 CellTags->"TextAnnotation",
